            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the paper a review is presented of current literature on the use of antileukotrienes in the treatment of allergic diseases in children. Recent reports suggest a role of cysteinyl leukotrienes in the development of inflammatory reaction in the airways, including bronchial remodelling.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
